Release 2.0.2.

Changelog: 26-11-2026 20:33:42

Fixed. The mouse wheel changes a list, a number field or a slider only after a click on it. Before, a wheel
turn over a window changed every value the pointer passed. Until the click, the wheel scrolls the page under it.
WheelGuard in widgets.py is a copy of core's.

Changelog: 25-11-2026 06:54:51

Release 2.0.1.

Changelog: 24-11-2026 15:16:11

Fixed. memtest_vulkan wrote its own memtest_vulkan.log into the folder the script was started from. It now runs in
